   "Job Title": "JavaScript Developer",
   "Job Description": "Software Engineer: Javascript\n\nAbout Naehas\n\nJoin a pre-IPO, fast-paced, rapidly growing software as a service company based in Silicon Valley. Naehas is a marketing offer and content orchestration platform that supports some of the largest consumer brands in the world. Our customers include four of the top six banks and market leaders in media, communication and insurance.\n\nWe’re expanding our office in the Gurugram area (India) and would like to fill it with team members who value autonomy, collaboration and meaningful work. Our recipe for success is very simple - “Passionate and happy employees translate into happy customers and a world-class product”.\n\nAbout the Position\n\nWe are seeking to hire a passionate Software Engineer to build features for our flagship naehas’ Platform.\n\nBasic Requirements:\n\nHands on with AngularJS or EmberJS JavaScript Development Framework\nJavaScript developer with at least 1 Yr hands-on experience.\nUnderstanding of HTML5 Features and its development\nHands on BackBoneJS, Framework 7, KnockoutJS is Plus.\nSolid knowledge of javascript and css3, bootstrap.\nPrior experience working on enterprise web applications is a plus.\nKnowledge of working with RESTFul API's\nNeeds to be able to produce code in a fast paced environment.\nStrong problem solving and debugging skills required. -\nPreferred Qualifications:\n\nLeading individual projects/sub-projects.\nLeading team of 2-6 members.\nComputer Science degree from a selective university.\n\nNaehas is a company of people committed to:\n\nProviding the Customer with the finest software backed by consistently top-quality service.\nDelivering our software and services efficiently, thus ensuring fair prices to the Customer and a sound investment for the shareholder.\nTreating the Customer as we expect to be treated –putting the Customer first every day -and meaning it.\nBeing leaders in innovation, quality, efficiency, and Customer satisfaction. Being known for doing the little things and the big things well.\nInsisting on an inclusive environment where every single person is given the encouragement, support, and opportunity to be successful.\nExpecting and accepting from ourselves nothing short of the best. Remembering that each of us makes the unassailable difference.\n\nNaehas is a company of people who expect to:\n\nBe treated fairly. • Work hard in an environment absolutely committed to excellence and Customer satisfaction.\nWork with people who respect each other as important individuals. • Have meaningful work to do and the education, equipment, and support to do it.\nKnow what is required of them and be kept candidly informed of their performance and progress.\nBe judged individually by the quality and consistency of their effort, enthusiasm, honesty, and results.\nBe encouraged to offer suggestions and ideas with the understanding that each will be promptly considered and responded to; be able to reasonably speak their minds.\nReceive ample information about the company’s plans, activities, and results. If these values resonate with you then we look forward to meeting you.\n\nIf these values resonate with you then we look forward to meeting you. Here’s what we have to offer you as a team member at Naehas:\n\nCompetitive salary package that will continue to grow as you gain experience.\nA full suite of benefits including health insurance, team parties, outdoor tours, and much more.\nA casual workplace that appreciates and respects each employee's ideas.\nThe agility of a growing and profitable start-up environment building marketing solutions for the largest Fortune 50 customers.\nMentor-ship by some fabulous engineers with a track record of delivering major pieces of software for both large companies and successful startups.\nFlexible work arrangements."
