   "Job Description": "Classpro is India’s leading online software for coaching classes. With 1000+ coaching classes using it daily in 7+ cities, it is changing the way coaching classes manage their business in India. We are a small team of young, highly enthusiastic, creative and performance driven people who will do anything (literally) to deliver the best possible user experience to our customers. That's exactly what we are looking in you!\n\nInterested to know more about our how we use technology and our learning. See our classpro's engineering blog.\nWhat we are looking for ?\nWe are looking for talented Javascript developer who want to join our engineering team to build great application for Education domain. You will be taking a senior/lead role in building React / React Native / Javascript applications.\n\nThe position requires a developer with experience and expertise building modern web applications and mobile web apps using the latest front-end technology. At Classpro we are using ReactJs/Javascript to build our next generation platform.\nRoles and Responsibilities:\nUnderstand the product requirements from Product Owner & convert visuals to interactive web interfaces.\nDevelop new user-facing features\nWrite reusable code and build libraries for future use\nEnsure the technical feasibility of UI/UX designs\nOptimize application for maximum speed and scalability\nYou have experience building a product using a mainstream library or framework (ReactJS ecosystem preferred)\nCollaborate with Product Designers, Product Managers, and Backend Engineers to deliver compelling user-facing products.\nSkills & Requirements:\nExpert knowledge of React, React Native, Redux, Javascript, HTML, CSS and related tools/packages\nJob perks:\nLearning Atmosphere & Fun Environment\nSaturday is a learning day.\nEvents and team activities!\nTraining and development budget\n3 - 6 Lacs p.a. (may vary depending on talent/experience)"
