   "Job Title": "Backend Developer",
   "Job Description": "Responsibilities and Duties :\nDeveloping, deploying and maintaining PHP based web applications.\nCreate solutions for the backend systems to support of users.\nDeploy the web applications on various types of production environment (Linux, Windows servers etc).\nWork in coordination with frontend developers in designing architecture and implement designing strategy\nUnderstand the database architecture and provide necessary optimization of the same.\nReview/Improve upon current processes/methodologies.\nMonitoring development activities and reporting project progress\nRequired Experience, Skills and Qualifications :\nMust have 4-5 years of experience in developing web applications using core PHP and Wordpress.\nMust be knowledgeable/have experience working on AWS Server (Certification preferred).\nSolid knowledge of AJAX, JavaScript, HTML, CSS3, Boostrap.\nSound Knowledge of web deployment concepts, web services such as REST and SOAP APIs.\nExpert knowledge of MySQL and database technologies.\nExperience with MVC and OOP design patterns.\nJob Type: Full-time\nSalary: ₹300,000.00 - ₹650,000.00 per year\nSchedule:\nDay shift\nExperience:\nPHP: 4 years (Required)\nApplication Question:\nDo you have experience of working on AWS?\nWork Remotely:\nTemporarily due to COVID-19"
