   "Job Description": "Job Summary\nPublished on : 2 days ago\nVacancy : 1\nEmployment Status : Full Time\nExperience : 2 - 4 Yrs\nSalary : Not disclosed\nInterview Venue : Ernakulam\nJob Description\nWe are looking for strong, self-directed software developers who are confident in their skill set, but also open to learning new things and tackling new and interesting challenges.\n\nWhat You Will Be Doing:\n\nWorking directly with the product team to bring our product to the top.\nCreating code utilizing Python, Django, HTML and CSS.\nExperience in creating microservices-based applications\nDeploying Web applications to Linux environments\nTroubleshooting bugs or other difficult problems to solve\n\nApply if you are a candidate with expertise in the following areas:\n\nPython and Django\nRelational Databases\nWebservices\nGit\nSoftware design with a focus on maintainability and extensibility\nExtra credits if you know:\n\nNode\nReact\nElastic Stack\n\nSkills\n\nPython Scripting , Python , PostgreSQL , Odoo Development , Django framework ,\n\nQualifications\n\nBE / B.Tech Engineering - Computer Science / IT\nMaster of Computer Applications (MCA)\nB.Sc. Computer Science"
