   "FIELD1": 544,
   "Job Title": "Django Developer",
   "Job Description": "Asiaville is a multilingual original content network focused on Audio, Video and Text based digital native storytelling formats. It currently comprises four language verticals: Tamil, Malayalam, Hindi and English.\nRole: Full Stack developer PYTHON/DJANGO\nAt Asiaville you will be part of our core engineering team which is responsible to develop highly scalable products.\nResponsibilities:\nDevelop and deliver technical solutions for business and accountable for the quality of the technical deliverables\nProvide and implement technical solutions, architect product(s), define timelines, advise on industry best practice\nSolve problems through algorithms, APIs, amazing user interfaces and align solutions to market needs\nRoutine day involves writing code for web applications, doing effective peer code review, coding (REST/3rd party) API's, integrating apps with cloud platforms like AWS machine learning API's.\nRequired:\n- 3+ years of development experience with strong Programming skills and willingness to learn new tools/software\n- Expert in PYTHON and DJANGO\n- Hands-on experience in software development on Front-end technologies (HTML, JS, CSS, J-Query, Bootstrap)\n- MYSQL / MongoDB hands-on is mandatory.\n- API development (REST) hands-on is mandatory.\n- Prior experience in any Content Management System\n- Good knowledge/experience of cloud platforms like AWS and continuous Integration & Deployment.\n- Deliver high quality solutions and code to meet the business needs through technology, Architecture and solutions\n- Troubleshoot, test, and maintain the core product software and databases to ensure strong optimization and features are intact.\n- Willingness to work both as part of a team and individual contribution\n- Must have the willingness to try and implement new approaches to solving problems.\n- A desire to work as part of a growing, fast-paced, and highly flexible product team.\nJob Type: Full-time\nApplication Deadline: 15/12/2020\nJob Type: Full-time\nSchedule:\nDay shift\nExperience:\nPYTHON / DJANGO: 3 years (Preferred)\nSOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT: 3 years (Preferred)\nJava: 1 year (Preferred)\nMYSQL: 3 years (Preferred)\nEducation:\nBachelor's (Preferred)\nWork Remotely:\nNo"
