   "Job Description": "Experience: 2-4 years\nLocation: Pune Bangalore\n\nRequirements:\nDesign and build advanced applications for the native iOS platform\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features.\nUnit-test code for robustness, including edge cases, usability, and general reliability.\nWork on bug fixing and improving application performance.\nContinuously discover, evaluate, and implement new technologies to maximize development efficiency.\n\nSkills:\nProficient with Objective-C and/or Swift, Cocoa Touch\nExperience with iOS frameworks such as Core Data, Core Animation, etc.\nExperience with offline storage, threading, and performance tuning\nFamiliarity with RESTful APIs to connect iOS applications to back-end services\nUnderstanding of Apple’s design principles and interface guidelines\nKnowledge of low-level C-based libraries is preferred\nExperience with performance and memory tuning with tools such as Instruments\nFamiliarity with cloud message APIs and push notifications\nKnack for benchmarking and optimization\nProficient understanding of code versioning tools\nWhat You Need for this Position\nYou should have knowledge of:\nSwift\nObjective C DB\nDesign Patterns\nUI understanding\nAditional\nNo. of Positions\nEducation level\nCareer level\nExperienced"
