   "Job Title": "Wordpress Developer",
   "Job Description": "LOCATION: * Amanora Chambers, Magarpatta, Hadapsar, Pune\nOffice Time: Day Shift (need to be available during USA hours to talk to clients)*\n\\*\\*\nJob Summary*\nBusiness Promoted is a subsidiary of USA based leading digital marketing company, Inetapplication LLC. We are Google's official partner for their flagship product - Google ads. Headquarted in Florida, USA, Business Promoted is expanding its India operations at our new office in Amanora Chambers, Hadapsar, Pune. More information can be found at www.businesspromoted.com\n\\*\\*\nResponsibilities and Duties*\nWe need a professional Web Designer with experience in WordPress to take over the *graphic and user interface design* of our websites. We’re looking for a candidate who has created and maintained functional, attractive websites for companies. we prefer experience in clean, modern, responsive websites with excellent navigational structures and detailed linking.\nWho is the right person for this position?*If you can design clean and sleek website pages and landing pages for a business in word press using themes and plugins, a design that has very high conversion rate of website visitors in to clients… then you are the right person for this position !!!\nDeliverables: * As a website designer, you will be responsible for following deliverables:\ncreate attractive & functional websites that are\nresponsive\nload within 3 seconds (google page speed insights, GTmetrix, pingdom)\ncreate relevant graphics, images or media elements on website pages to improve conversions\nQualification & Experience: *\nMinimum of 2 years of web development experience with a good technical understanding of WordPress, SEO, websites, and CMS platforms\nExperience of responsive web design and progressive enhancement with the ability to troubleshoot and resolve cross-device and browser issues\nHas worked on projects all the way from inception to pushing to production\nExperienced in PHP, HTML, CSS and JS development, ideally with considerable experience working with complex WordPress projects\nKnows how to work with third-party WordPress themes as well as creating their own\nAbility to understand essential tools such as FTP, HTTP etc\nExperience integrating third-party API\nSolid understanding of technical on-site SEO\nSolid understanding of web security\nFamiliarity with DNS configurations, CDNs and SSL\nGood eye for design user-friendly web pages\nStrong conceptual skills, develop visual workflows and concepts to create engaging webpages\nMust work well under pressure and tight deadline\nAbility to work in a fast-paced environment, deal with uncertainty, and manage multiple projects at a time\nJob Types: Full-time, Part-time\n\nPay: ₹20,000.00 - ₹30,000.00 per month\n\nBenefits:\nProvident fund (PF)\nPaid leaves / Leave encashment\nFlexible work hours\nShift allowance\nIndustry:\nSoftware Development"
