   "Job Title": "Node js developer",
   "Job Description": "Greetings from WebCodeGenie Technologies Pvt Ltd!!*\nWebCodeGenie Technologies Pvt Ltd is collaborative team of talented, driven and principled people who are passionate about software, brought together because they want to do something amazing. WebCodeGenie has a huge clientele. Our clients have been with us ever since we have worked for them. We are working since 2010 in a Web Development and Designing with highly talented employees.\nDesignation : *Junior Node.JS Developer & Senior NodeJs Developer\nLocation: *Ahmedabad (Only Gujarat state candidate can apply for this position)\nMin. Experience: * For Junior NodeJs (1 year) and Senior NodeJs Developer (2.5+ years)\nSalary: **Depends on skills and interview*\nKey Skills: *\nExcellent knowledge of object-oriented Javascript language\nMust have and knowledge of ExpresJS framework and Node Package Manager\nCritical thinker and problem solving skills\nGood understanding of asynchronous programming concepts\nKnowledge in a front end scripting language like Javascript and JQuery\nGood understanding of front-end technologies, such as HTML5, and CSS3\nUnderstanding fundamental design principles behind a scalable application\nExperience with JSON and RESTful services implementation\nFamiliarity with MongoDB databases and their declarative query languages and must have the ability to create databases schemas\nWriting clean code with comments and must be aware of coding standards of the latest version of ECMAScript\nProfessional, precise communication skills\nGood to have: *\nUnderstanding accessibility and security compliance\nIntegration of multiple data sources and databases into one system\nKnowledge of deploying applications on the server\nBasic understanding of code versioning tools, such as GIT\nExperience with JavaScript and Typescript are a plus\nExperience working with agile work environment\nWith this we are also taking care of following things: *\nOur employees are enjoying their Saturday and Sunday as we are working 5 days a week.\n12 days annual paid leaves\n11 Public Holidays\nEncasing Paid leave in each quarter\nGet chance to earn Handsome Incentives.\nWe always have a birthday bash for each employee\nWe never miss any chance to enjoy special occasions.\nCelebration for top most festivals.\nHealthy work culture\nMonthly employee engagement activities\nNo Bond System\nJob Type: Full-time\n\nSalary: Up to ₹55,000.00 per month\n\nExperience:\nNodejs: 1 year (Preferred)\ntotal work: 1 year (Preferred)\nEducation:\nBachelor's (Preferred)\nBenefits:\nPaid leaves / Leave encashment\nWork Remotely:\nTemporarily due to COVID-19"
