   "FIELD1": 764,
   "Job Title": "Software Engineer",
   "Job Description": "Advanced Business and Healthcare Solutions Pvt Ltd\n\nRole: Software Engineer\n\nWe’re Advanced\n\nJoin a business that embraces innovation, gives you the scope to seize every opportunity and will help get you where you want to go. Life at Advanced begins in an unprecedented environment with a role that matters, taking you on a fast-paced journey of discovery, however big that might be.\n\nWe are one of the UK’s largest and fastest growing software companies. True partnership is the defining thing that makes us different from the competition. We pride ourselves on delivering focused software solutions for public sector, enterprise commercial and health & care organisations that simplify complex business challenges and deliver immediate value.\n\nResponsibilities\n\no Deliver specific allocated requirements as part of a wider deliverable, including input into designs\n\no Focus on coding and unit testing of changes to the product\n\no Analyse and implement the requirements given to the team\n\no Write unit and UI tests to identify malfunctions\n\no Complete work items as part of a formal software development lifecycle\n\no Deliver software to high quality and within agreed timescales\n\nSkills\n\no Required 3 - 5 years of experience\no Angular 8, SQL, HTML 5, WPF, Azure, Web development, C# .net Auth\n\no In-depth knowledge of C# and .NET\n\no Strong understanding of OOPs design, design patterns and programming skills\n\no Experience with third-party libraries and APIs\n\no Ability to perform in a team environment\n\no Excellent analytical skills with a good problem-solving attitude\n\no Stay up to date with new technology trends\n\nJoin the ‘A’ team!\n\nWe hire for potential and develop at pace. Recruiting people with potential, our focus is on what you might be capable of achieving. We look for aspiration and passionately believe that your individual personality and core strengths are what can make you right for us. We want you to learn, to discover, to experiment, to make a difference.\n\nSo, if you can reimagine your future in a vibrant growing company, we would like to hear from you. We are an equal opportunity employer, committed to removing bias from the hiring process.\n\nVisit us at https://www.oneadvanced.com/"
