   "Job Title": "DevOps Engineer",
   "Job Description": "Cutting-edge technology\nWell funded-startup\nAbout Our Client\nOur client is a tech startup that gives solutions for logistics problems.\nJob Description\nAs a DevOps Engineer, you will be responsible for:\nTo execute the development and management of infrastructure architecture blueprints\nInstall, configure and manage server monitoring tools\nManage overall capacity utilization of server/hardware environment ensuring it is optimized\nManage the IT infrastructure, Communication (LAN, WAN, email, etc.), database, backup recovery, regulatory compliance\nOptimizing the server build and code deploy process\nWorking with software engineers to deploy code regularly\nThe Successful Applicant\nA successful candidate has:\nPossess at least 3 years experience in DevOps/SysAdmin/System Engineer\nExperience with Bash, Python, Cloud Platform, MongoDB, Cassandra, ElasticSearch, CI/CD (Jenkins), and Ansible\nAble to collaborate effectively and create open communication cross-functionally\nExcellent communication skills with a good command of English & able to communicate effectively with stakeholders from multiple levels\nWhat's on Offer\nWork for a well-funded startup\nInternational working environment\nExposure to cutting-edge technology"
