   "Job Title": "Software Engineer",
   "Job Description": "GSN Games is looking for a Software Engineer (Java) to join our team in Bangalore!\n\nJackpot! About the GSN Games Casino Studio:\nSlots, bingo, cards, and more! Work on incredible games, including a top-10 grossing app, alongside the best in the business.\n\nAbout the Role:\nYou have a solid understanding of web and mobile stacks building critical application features using industry-standard engineering best practices. You have experience working with large scale applications. You are an enthusiastic and high energy worker, who thrives on being in a vibrant, creative, and fun work environment, building the back-end systems that power the games that millions of people play every day!\n\nJob Responsibilities:\nWork with team members to design, build and maintain new/existing features and products\nDefine engineering best practices\nProvide production support, system diagnosis, and troubleshooting\nSupport and be a critical part of our DevOps culture\n\nRequirements:\n2-4 years of software development experience\nExperience and skilled with Java/J2EE, including Spring and Hibernate\nExperience working on applications using SOA, REST design principles\nExperience working with scalable architectures and environment\nExperience with performance testing and tuning applications\nExperience working on multi-threaded applications\nStrong fundamentals in Data Structures and Algorithms\nA flexible self-starter who thrives on the challenges of working with new and varied technologies\nStrong understanding of design/programming best-practices and various design patterns\nExperience working in scrum/agile teams\nStrong communication skills\nBachelor's Degrees in Computer Science or work experience equivalent\n\nBonus Points!\nExperience and skilled with cloud-based services, especially Amazon Web Services (AWS)\nExperience with Mongo DB\nExperience working in the games industry\nLove playing games"
