   "Job Description": "Who we are:\n\nMobiquity is a digital engagement provider for more than 200 of the world’s leading brands. We are a collective of consultants, designers, developers, cloud advisors, and data scientists - spread across 3 continents and 9 offices - who create compelling digital experiences to help clients show they care to the people who matter most - their consumers, patients, and employees.\n\nAbout the Job:\n\nMobiquity is seeking a Principal iOS Developer with demonstrated experience designing and implementing enterprise scale mobile solutions. The ideal candidate will bring both strategic vision and solid execution skills to create native applications for mobile devices.\n\nResponsibilities:\nDesign and develop native mobile applications for iOS\nIntegrate mobile apps with RESTful web services\nWork with UX Designers, Mobile Architects and other Developers to build enterprise mobile solutions\nWork as part of an agile team on leading edge technologies\nSkills and Experience:\n7+ years experience developing applications software\nExcellent working knowledge of an object oriented language (Java, C++, Objective-C, C#, or similar) - including 4+ years Objective-C preferably on the iPhone\nDemonstrated expertise with Apple's iOS SDK (Cocoa, Cocoa Touch, etc.)\nExperience using RESTful APIs to integrate mobile applications to server side systems\nWorking knowledge of HTML5, CSS3, and Javascript a plus\nGood understanding of software development best practices\nExperience working in an agile environment\nWorking knowledge of SCM with strong emphasis on Git and proper Git Flow"
