   "Job Description": "Job Description:\nExperience : 3 - 5 Years\n3+ years of programming experience.\nShould love creating solutions involving large amounts of data for complex analytical problems.\nPassion to develop software that is highly optimized for:\n- Speed, building customized algorithms / approaches\n- Scale, leveraging hardware extensibility including cloud resources\n- Network usage, minimizing the amount of data that needs to be shipped around.\nExperience in C#/.NET or Python frameworks will be a plus but should be open to other technologies as need arises.\nShould have good knowledge of relational and/or NoSql databases\nBE / B.Tech from premier institutes with a first class academic track record.\nJob Responsibilities:\n\n• Design and develop software solutions to problems in the financial research domain ranging from processing large volumes of data, algorithms and approaches for developing insightful analysis.\n• Understand and apply financial concepts to technology solutions for business problems.\n• Work with different functional groups to get a better understanding of the challenges involved and devise optimized solutions.\n• Work in a fast-paced agile development."
