   "Job Title": "Machine Learning",
   "Job Description": "Job description: Machine Learning /Deep learning engineer\nExperience : 2-3 years\nWe are looking for an expert in machine learning to help us extract value from our data. You will lead all the processes from data collection, cleaning, and pre-processing, to training models and deploying them to production.\nThe ideal candidate will be passionate about artificial intelligence and stay up-to-date with the latest developments in the field.\nRequirements\n- Proven experience as a Machine Learning Engineer or similar role\n- Sufficient knowledge of most basic libraries like pandas, matplotlib,Sci-py etc.\n- Understanding of data structures, data modeling, and software architecture basics\n- Deep knowledge of maths, probability, statistics, and algorithms\n- Understanding of neural networks.\n- Expertise in visualizing and manipulating big datasets\n- Business process understanding and Requirement understanding skills.\n- Deploying models to production\n- Must be able to analyze the data to find relations between the input and the desired output.\n- Ability to write robust code in Python\n- Familiarity with machine learning/deep learning frameworks (like Tensorflow, Keras or PyTorch) and libraries (like sci-kit-learn, etc.)\n- Have worked in Google cloud platform/Microsoft Azure/IBM Watson like machine learning platforms (Nice to have)\n- Outstanding analytical and problem-solving skills\nResponsibilities\n- Designing and developing machine learning and deep learning systems.\n- Understanding and Working in real-life problems that can be solved/reduced with the help of data science and Machine Learning.\n- Running machine learning tests and experiments.\n- Implementing appropriate ML algorithms with good accuracy and performance.\n- Error reductions in models, validating models and deploying models with data pipelines in production.\nJob Type: Full-time\nSalary: ₹40,000.00 - ₹60,000.00 per month\nBenefits:\nFlexible schedule\nHealth insurance\nSchedule:\nDay shift\nExperience:\ntotal work: 2 years (Required)\nData Scientist: 2 years (Required)\nEducation:\nBachelor's (Required)\nWork Remotely:\nTemporarily due to COVID-19"
