   "Job Description": "Robro Systems is a fast-growth machine vision systems company and is looking for an A-grade Software Professional for our Software team. The software team works in the domains of Computer Vision, Deep Learning, Desktop Software and Cloud Integration. This is an opportunity to work in a fast-growth startup environment and be responsible for developing the product and the team.\nPosition: * AI Engineer\nResponsibilities and Duties: *\nIntegrate vision systems with various sensors/robotic systems\nWrite Modular, Readable and Well Documented C++/Python Software for creating workflows of vision-based inspection systems.\nUse and understand various machine vision software, eg. MVTech, InSight etc.\nDesign and implement algorithms for industrial and mobile robotic systems\nSkill(s) required: * Machine Vision, Experience of coding and a passion for it. C++/ Python Expertise, OpenCV preferred, Familiarity with Deep Learning and Cloud Integration.\nQualifications: *\n*\n3+ years of experience in fast-paced S/W development.\nProven experience with Computer Vision, Machine Learning, Controls and AI algorithms and libraries (OpenCV, ROS, TensorFlow, etc.),\nExperience with Image Processing Libraries such as OpenCV preferred\nExperience with sensors, interfaces and communication protocols\nBenefits: *Competitive pay, Stock options, Relocation assistance, Casual work environment, Living in the cleanest city of India, Balanced work-life, Open Start-up culture, Flat Hierarchy\n*# of positions available: * 2\n*Location: * Indore, MP, India with occasional travel\nJob Types: Full-time, Walk-In\nSchedule:\nDay shift\nExperience:\nfast paced S/W development.: 3 years (Required)\nEducation:\nBachelor's (Preferred)"
