   "Job Title": "DevOps Engineer",
   "Job Description": "About Accenture: Accenture is a leading global professional services company, providing a broad range of services in strategy and consulting, interactive, technology and operations, with digital capabilities across all of these services. We combine unmatched experience and specialized capabilities across more than 40 industries powered by the worlds largest network of Advanced Technology and Intelligent Operations centers. With 506,000 people serving clients in more than 120 countries, Accenture brings continuous innovation to help clients improve their performance and create lasting value across their enterprises. Visit us at www.accenture.com\nProject Role : SW/Application Tech Support Practitioner\nProject Role Description : Act as the ongoing interface between the client and the system or application. Dedicated to quality, using exceptional communication skills to keep our world class systems running. Can accurately define a client issue and can interpret and design a resolution based on deep product knowledge.\nManagement Level : 10\nWork Experience : 4-6 years\nWork Location : Pune\nMust Have Skills :DevOps\nGood To Have Skills :Ansible on Microsoft Azure,Python Programming Language\nJob Requirements :\nKey Responsibilities : A: Experienced in Python scripting and Ansible Person will be expert to create interfaces for Ansible tool set using Python\nB: Exposure in Python Web frame work Django / Flask\nWorking knowledge of Cisco NSO / Tail-f\nC: Knowledge of AWS and Network skills are added advantage\nTechnical Experience : A: Experienced in Python scripting and Ansible Person will be expert to create interfaces for Ansible tool set using Python\nB: Exposure in Python Web frame work Django / Flask\nWorking knowledge of Cisco NSO / Tail-f\nC: Knowledge of AWS and Network skills are added advantage\nProfessional Attributes : A:Good communication skills B:Good analytical skills"
