   "Job Description": "Job Information\n\nWork Experience\n4-6 years\nIndustry\nIT Services\nCity\nNoida\nState/Province\nUttar Pradesh\nZip/Postal Code\n201301\nJob Description\n\nJob Responsibilities:\n\nIntroduce DevOps practice to build and maintain our server infrastructure and automate service deployments.\n\nImprove our infrastructure for the ease of deployment, scalability, security, and fault-tolerance.\n\nDevelop tools and strategies for deployment, testing, and monitoring to achieve our goals in security, compliance, uptime, and automated infrastructure.\n\nWork closely with System Architects, Product Managers, and Developers to meet service automation needs.\n\nAutomate the deployment of our software and test pipelines, promote a quick turnaround for testing and development\n\nTroubleshoot and resolve issues in our development, staging, and production environments.\n\nDevelop a process to integrate DevOps with engineering development, service deployment, and operations lifecycle\n\nRequirements\n\nRequirements:\n\n3+ years of experience in DevOps role.\n\nStrong Amazon Web Services experience.\n\nWorking experience on Tomcat, Postgres/MongoDB, Apache, Nginx, ActiveMQ environments.\n\nBuild and release automation tools: Maven.\n\nExperience with Java Development or Deployment.\n\nStrong background in Linux/Unix Administration.\n\nAbility to use a wide variety of open source technologies and cloud services.\n\nQualifications and Skills:\n\nGraduate or Post Graduate in Computers.\n\nExperience:\n\nRelevant Experience should be 3-6 years."
