   "Job Description": "Description\n\nCompany Name : Quovantis Pvt. Ltd.\n\nLocation: - JanakPuri Delhi\n\nTeam Strength: 170+ people\n\nAbout the Company:\n\nAbout the position: Quovantis provides customize software service / help to develop software products and Mobile apps for their client. They follow lean principles of Scrum to develop products iteratively.\nDesignation: Python Developer\n\nExperience required- 2-4 years\n\nReporting To: Technical Lead\n\nVacancy: 4\n\nCab- No\nWorking Days: 5\nShift: Day shift job\n\nJob Location: New Delhi\n\nROLE AND RESPONSIBILITIES\n\nIn this role you will be expected to\n\nWrite advanced Python programs\nWrite object oriented applications using Python\nTake full ownership of your code\nQuickly understand project requirements\nBe smartly inquisitive\nAbility to quickly get into the details and have a grasp of the problem at hand\nHave a mindset of suggesting solutions to problems\nThink of edge cases before even starting to write the code\nUnderstand agile and scrum processes\nHunger to learn every day\nWork as part of a team and ready to help others\nBe excellent at listening to others and also expressing yourself clearly\nWork independently most of the time\nFind your success in the success of your product\nBe a geek that uses technology to solve his/her own problems whenever possible\nEnjoys working on multiple problems at the same time\n\nQUALIFICATIONS AND EDUCATION REQUIREMENTS\n\nPreferably B.E., B.Tech. or MCA\n2-4 years of experience writing object oriented code using Python\n\nPREFERRED SKILLS\n\nStrong knowledge of Python\nWorking experience on developing Web Applications using Django/Flask\nFull stack Python Developer having worked from UI to Backend\nHave worked on ORM tools like SqlAlchemy\nGood working experience in database and can write advanced SQL queries\nHave worked on asynchronous programming model like rabbitmq, celery etc. will be a plus\nWorking knowledge of HTML, CSS, jQuery and other web technologies\nKnowledge of AngularJs, KnockoutJs would be a plus\nKnowledge of Redis or Memcache as caching stores is a plus"
