   "Job Description": "We are looking for a Node JS Developer who is result oriented, believes in leading from the front and always willing to go the extra mile. Has strong knowledge building scalable solutions in Node JS and eager to learn about new technologies.\n\nEducation Qualification: B.E/B.Tech/M.C.A/Any Graduate\n\nExperience: 3 to 4 years\n\nSalary: As Per Industry Standards\n\nEmployment Type: Full-Time\n\nJob Location: Noida (Uttar Pradesh)\n\nSkills & Responsibilities\nMinimum 2 year of experience planning and implementing projects in MEAN platform.\nExperience in web development technologies like AngularJS, NodeJS, GIT, NPM, Grunt is must.\nLaravel, Zend Framework, Symfony, CodeIgnitor, CMS, experience is an added advantage\nDevelopment experience on REST/SOAP web services.\nFamiliarity with newer specifications of EcmaScript\nExperience with relational databases (e.g. MySQL/MSSQL) and key-value and document-based databases (e.g. DynamoDB, MongoDB)\nExperience in using and developing GraphQL APIs\nExperience designing and building Micro-Services on cloud-based platforms using AWS lambda.\nDecent communication skills"
