   "Job Title": "Wordpress Developer",
   "Job Description": "A talented coder who knows the nitty gritty of wordpress development, theming & plugins.\n\nJob Description\n\nWe are looking for a talented WordPress developer who knows WordPress inside out. The candidate must be passionate about creating high quality wordpress websites, themes and plugins. The developer will work closely with our project management team, designers and other developers.\n\nJob Role\nDevelop high-quality responsive WordPress websites.\nCode WordPress plugins from scratch.\nModify themes and plugins as per requirements.\nEnhance & fix bugs in existing wordpress sites and plugin.\nIntegrate various third-party APIs.\nSecurity evaluation and code optimisation for improved website load time.\nRequirements\nB.tech/BE/MCA/Graduate or Equivalent qualifications in Computer Science.\nStrong experience (1 to 5 years) in Core PHP 7+ with MySQL and other DBMS.\nDeep knowledge of WordPress CMS and its popular plugins, themes\nWell verse with HTML5/CSS3, Javascript, jQuery and AJAX.\nExcellent knowledge of OOPs, data structures, SDLC, HTTP and RDBMS.\nShould be good in developing the algorithms for complex problems.\nKnowledge of web development processes, XML Structures, Session & Cookies Handling and Version Control.\nKnowledge in one or more other CMS like Magento, Drupal, Shopify, CraftCMS etc is a plus.\nOther Requirements\nKnowledge of server commands, web servers, migration of servers, etc to carry out the project. Knowledge on AWS is an added advantage.\nCan understand client’s requirement & functional specifications and propose the solutions.\nWriting clean, reusable code with strong emphasis on stability, security and performance.\nDelivering on time and according to requirements.\nProactive person who can take ownership and meet the deadlines.\nExcellent problem-solving and testing skills.\nCan adapt new skills as per the project’s need.\nHOW TO APPLY\n\nSend us your CV, and current ctc to our email address hr[at]xieno.com or use our job application form by clicking the ‘’ button.\nExperience: 2+ years"
