   "Job Description": "We are looking for an expert developer with superstar iOS development skills. Working as part of a cross-functional team following agile practices to deliver iOS apps. You will be expected to follow best software practices including testing, test automation, code reviews, refactoring and pairing.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\nDeliver and maintain new and existing iOS Apps.\nSupport your team to meet sprint commitments.\nEnsure that impediments of any kind are escalated and long term solutions pursued.\nDeliver high quality well tested software that meets agreed requirements.\nPromote best software development practices.\nCollaborate.\nSupport and promote agile practices including Scrum and XP.\n\nKnowledge, Skills and Experience:\n\nMinimum 3 years experience developing non trivial iOS Apps that have been released in the app store.\nGood Knowledge on the Libraries/API's as Facebook iOS SDK, Twitter iOS SDK, Google Analytics API, Flurry, Amazon API, Google Maps API, Google Ads API, Facebook API, Facebook SDK, Facebook Open Graph API and OpenGL.\nStrong proficiency in Swift and associated Design Patterns.\nSolid understanding of software engineering.\nExperience writing tests, automating these and adopting TDD desirable.\nGood knowledge of web technologies and paradigms (JSON, Ajax, AMF, HTTP, REST).\nTeam working experience.\nNice to have a knowledge and understanding of concurrent programming.\nNice to have an understanding of profiling tools and memory management."
