   "Job Title": "Network Administrator",
   "Job Description": "We are inviting you to our highly talented team as a Network Engineer.\nAny city in India, remote.\nFluent is an exclusive global boutique fintech software firm that provides the world’s largest global banks and hedge funds with state-of-the-art technology. Fluent is comprised of highly talented senior software engineers who have built and maintained Fluent’s proprietary revolutionary and disruptive technology.\nPlease visit us at https://fluenttech.net/\nBe a part of our Innovative and Energetic IT team, searching and introducing technologies to boost our product. Challenging and fascinating work environment.\nYour working hours: 8:00 - 17:00 India time\n- Configure firewalls, routers, and switches for Fluent and its clients\n- Provide complex networking solution to fluent and it’s Clients\n- Install, configure and optimize servers for the customer and internal use.\n- Communicate with clients, vendors and product support.\n- Client Tier-2 Support for fluent Software and hosted solutions\nDesired Skills & Experience:\n- Experience of at least 3 years as a Network Administrator.\n- Networking: experienced with routing protocols such as BGP, OSPF, RIP), understand the notion of ACL’s Network address translations, understand TCP/UDP unicast and multicast traffic including Multicast routing, ability to troubleshoot using advanced techniques. Experience with common hardware: Arista, Cisco, Juniper, Force10, and Fortigate. Palo Alto Firewalls. work with Wireshark.\n- Sys. Admin proficiency in main Linux OS flavors: Redhat and CentOS 7.x\n- Scripting: at least one of the following: BASH, Python, Perl\n- English Fluency, ability to communicate with abroad clients, vendors and employees.\nAdvantage:\n- Monitoring Software skills (Nagios, Centreon, etc)\n- Microsoft Windows Server Proficiency: Administration level.\n- Internal Infrastructure maintenance (IPMI, BMC, iDRAC, ILO)\n- Server configuration management: puppet/chef/salt/Ansible\nHadoop cluster, Elasticsearch cluster management, the use of Grafana\nDataCenter hands-on experience, Backup Tapes (Linux Environment)\n- TOPICS which are advisable for the candidate: work with VM and Low Latency aspects of servers: From Network cards such as Solareflares to BIOS and OS optimization\nYou are more than welcome to join our team!\nСрок действия договора: 12 месяцев\nJob Type: Full-time\nExperience:\ntotal work: 5 years (Required)\nLanguage:\nEnglish fluent (Required)\nApplication Question:\nPlease, describe your:\nnetwork education and expertise (including equipment users, routing protocols including multicast routing, BGP (must have) , troubleshooting, PBR's (policy based rules?), etc)\nFirewall and security experience and knowledge\nVPN (site to site) including creation of GRE tunneling,\n*Unix/Linux.\nThank you!\nBenefits:\nWork from home\nIndustry:\nSoftware Development\nWork Remotely:\nYes"
