   "Job Description": "Description\n\nDesignation: Python Sr. Developer (Python + Django)\n\nJob Location: Gurgaon\n\nReporting To: V.P. Engineering\n\nVacancy: 1\n\nWorking Days: 5\nExperience: 5-8 years\n\nObjective of the position:\n\nDrive new / existing product development initiatives Key Competencies:\n\n• Expert programmer – exceptional skills in frameworks, new solutions development, system design, enhancement and modernization (Must Have: Python, Django, Mysql, Front-end technologies (AngularJS preferred); Preferred: Redis/Memcache)\n\n• Proven project management skills (Preferred: Scrum) including responsibility for delivering to Effort estimations, Schedule Planning, execution and expertise in providing technical solutions.\n\n• Ability to simultaneously work on and manage multiple tasks within the same assignment and prioritize effectively.\n\n• Strong Architecture knowledge and skill – experience of building architecture to build systems that supports business goals. Understanding of various architectural styles.\n\n• Highly motivated individual with ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment.\n\n• Strong interpersonal skills and able to interact effectively within teams, external team (Marketing, Sales, Product), management and partners.\n\n• Strong analytical ability to create innovative solutions, logical and problem-solving approach on complex issues.\n\n• Familiarity with One Code run everywhere (Web/Windows/Mobile etc.). Roles/Responsibilities:\n\nAs a development Team Lead you will be responsible for:\n\n• Project and Release management – this will include\n\n• managing end to end delivery of projects, measuring and adhering to defined TATs\n\n• Allocation of resources and people management\n\n• Cross team collaboration (QA, Product, Business) to ensure project implementation\n\n• Create process frameworks –\n\n• To propose solutions by developing documentation, flowcharts, layouts, diagrams, charts, code comments and clear code\n\n• To determine operational feasibility by evaluating analysis, problem definition, requirements, solution development and proposed solutions\n\n• Designing solutions and architecture:\n\n• Convert product specs to tech specs\n\n• Feasibility analysis of products\n\n• Train and coach other team members Academic Qualifications: BE/ B. Tech Experience: 5 years plus. Incumbent should have had prior experience of working on new solutions, technologies, creating architecture. Should have managed a team (at least 10-14 people)"
