   "Job Title": "Software Engineer",
   "Job Description": "We are looking looking for exceptionally talented Software Development Engineers in Test who can lead to deliver\ncontinuous improvement to the quality of our Big-Data enterprise products. You will do this through your skills to\nwrite complex test cases and deep understanding of automation tools, testing methodologies, and CI/CD\n(continuous integration and deployment) processes.\n\nWhat You'll Do ( Responsibilities)\nDesign and build advanced automated testing frameworks, tools and automated test suites using\njava, python & javascript based solutions such as JUnit, Selenium, Jasmine etc.\nBuild, enhance and maintain automation frameworks for scalability, stability and performance on\nHadoop.\nScale up test automation practices to ensure robust release quality.\nGood knowledge of test methodologies, creating test cases and test plans.\nDefine the optimum suites for sanity, regression, smoke, deployment, verification etc., and\nadvanced aspects of system testing automation.\nWhat We're Looking For ( Required Skills )\nBS/MS in Computer Science or related field\n3-9 years experience in test development and automation framework development.\nEither of \"Performance testing expertise\" or \"Past experience with Build and Release processes -CI/CD\"\nExcellent problem solving and programming skills\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills. Ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a team.\nEye for detail - never letting things fall through cracks\nPreferred Skills\nAn educational background from a college of repute\nPast experience managing sizable Hadoop cluster, with all included services\nFull stack development experience\nPast experience in Test Driven Development\nWhy Infoworks?\n\nWe have an amazing culture of brilliant minds and extraordinary execution. This is the right place at the right time to join a game-changing #bigdata technology company.\n\nInfoworks provides the only data operations and orchestration system that delivers end-to-end automation for your business' rapidly growing analytics needs. Founded in 2014 and headquartered in Palo Alto, we are funded by Centerview Capital Technology, Nexus Venture Partners, and Knoll Ventures."
