   "Job Title": "Machine Learning",
   "Job Description": "Job Summary\nWe are a STEM Education provider and on expansion to the international market. Research & Training are the most important technical roles in our company structure. It involves product development research, testing, validation and curriculum building activities in Robotics, 3D printing, IoT, Drones, Ml & AI for K-12 students.\nResponsibilities and Duties\n· Nurture Innovation and Creativity at K-12 School level students by mentoring and helping them to develop Innovative Projects.\n· Research and develop new STEM materials and curriculum on Robotics, Electronics, 3D printing, IoT, Drones, Ml & AI for K- 12 students.\n· Act as an Innovation Mentor/Coach to other staffs and students to generate innovative ideas among students.\nResponsible for leading training programs and workshops in the fields of Robotics, 3D printing, IoT, Drones, Ml & AI for the company.\nManage projects for developing new products and services from concept through commercialization\nCoordinate and lead the documentation of customer requirements, design documents, procedures, and product manuals\nPlay a key role in our R&D department by providing support as needed to help operate and grow the business\nWorks with the marketing teams and develops digital marketing plans across all online channels, including media, email, website, mobile, and social media\nAbility to be flexible in a changing work environment and to work well under pressure with results-oriented.\nStrong written, oral communication, presentation skills, and cross-functional leadership skills\nWork closely with our management team, administrative staff, and engineers to ensure projects are performed on time, on budget and to the highest level of quality\nStrong team player and ability to work cooperatively and effectively with others in team\nKey Skills\nResearch Development, Technical Support, Electronics, CAD, AI & ML, Embedded systems, Python\nOther Skills\nSelf starter, Self learner, Team builder, Presentation skill, strong verbal and written communication skills, time punctuality, excellent time management skills and results-driven attitude\nLanguage\nEnglish - required\nHindi - preferred\nExpected Start Date: 1/1/2021\nJob Type: Full-time\nSalary: ₹15,000.00 - ₹20,000.00 per month\nBenefits:\nCommuter assistance\nExperience:\ntotal work: 1 year (Required)\nEducation:\nBachelor's (Required)\nRequired travel:\n25% (Required)\nIndustry:\nEducation & Instruction\nWork Remotely:\nTemporarily due to COVID-19\nSpeak with the employer\n+91 9061676737"
