   "Job Description": "Location: Bangalore\n\nNumber of Positions: 2\n\nNo. of desired Yrs of exp.:4-5\n\nAcademic Qualification Desired : B Tech / MCA/ MSC Computer science\n\nRequired Job Skills (Technical)\n\nExpert in Python, with knowledge of Django framework.\nStrong knowledge in Databases like PostgreSQL/ MySQL/ SQL Server\nBasic understanding of front-end technologies, such as JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3.\nExperience in React /ASP.net is a plus.\nStrong unit test and debugging skills.\nKnowledge in search engines like elastic search/ Solr is an added advantage\n\nDescription of the roles & responsibility\n\nExperience as full stack/back end developer with expertise in Python (Django) and PostgreSQL/ My Sql/ Sql server Database.\nYou will be involved in developing, testing and maintaining software Products on a release by release basis.\nDesign and develop and deploy scalable and high quality applications/Products using Python, Django, among other technologies\nCreate technical documentation and unit testing for software you develop. Work with teams across multiple geographies.\nTroubleshoot and fix issues reported by QA and Customers and help product support\nWork in Agile Teams using Agile Software Development Methodology\nTeam Management Skills & Gathering Client Requirements"
