   "Job Description": "JForce Solutions is looking for freshers who have excellent coding skills and who can start contributing right away.\nApplicants who have done freelancing, multiple project and application development on their own are preferred. There will be a bond of 2 years for this position. The job location will be Vileparle west, Mumbai.\nInterview Process:\nYou must be knowing to code on Java platform. As part of the interview, we will ask you to develop a mini-project remotely. If completed, you will be working remotely until lockdown is over. Post which you will need to work at our office premises at Vileparle west, Mumbai.\nResponsibilities and Duties\nDevelopment of multiple cutting-edge technologies like\nSpringboot, J2EE, Java, Tomcat, mySQL\nReactJS\nMobile App development\nSalesforce cloud based development\nKey Skills\nJava, JavaScript, React, ReactJS, Spring, Tomcat, MySQL, Salesforce, Android, iOS, API, Cloud, Salesforce, Springboot\nExpected Start Date: 7/12/2020\nJob Type: Full-time\nSalary: ₹256,266.00 - ₹1,194,812.00 per year\nSchedule:\nDay shift\nExperience:\ntotal work: 1 year (Preferred)\njava: 1 year (Preferred)\nEducation:\nBachelor's (Preferred)\nWork Remotely:\nTemporarily due to COVID-19"
