   "Job Title": "Flutter Developer",
   "Job Description": "Hello Friends,\nWe are Urgently Hiring for Flutter Developer for Mumbai Location.\nCompany Profile : Our Client is a Limited Company with a turnover of 4000+ Crore and More than 1000+ employees all over India .\nJob Location : Andheri \\_Western Line Of Mumbai\nCTC : Rs. 6 Lacs To Rs. 9 Lacs PA\nInterested candidates please share their updated resume with current ctc , expected ctc and notice period on mangaljobs(at)gmail.com\nFor any query please feel free to call me on *8779505064 / 9004940231*\nDesired Candidate Profile:\n1) Any Computer science or Computer Engineering Candidate with Minimum 2 years and above in developing production level applications using flutter and Translating UI/UX designs into code , integrating 3rd party libraries\n2) Candidates age from 21 to 35 years only apply\n3) Candidates from western line of Mumbai will be preferred .\n4) General knowledge of Web service integration (SOAP, REST/JSON, GraphQL)\n5) Experience in building mobile applications with Firebase.\n6) Strong understanding of the dart syntax , design patterns like MVVM , JavaScript , Google’s Android design principles and interface guidelines , Set up CI/CD for Flutter project\n7) Candidates must have developed at least 3 mobile apps from start to end independently and published on Play store and AppStore.\n8) Must have experience in developing localized apps for different countries.\n9) Good team player with good communication skill\n10) End-to-end understanding and capability of managing the app publishing process for both Android & iOS\n11) Developer should have prior experience of working on multi-platform dynamic apps based on Flutter (mandatory) with apps hosted on Play store/Apple Store, Preferable if has additional knowledge of native languages and platforms (Android, Java, etc) Experience in Rest APIs, Dar, Knowledge of MySQL and NoSQL\nJob Profile : -\nAs a Flutter Developer, you will create multi-platform apps for iOS and Android using Google's Flutter development framework.\n\n#flutter #ios #android #mobileappdevelopment #productionapps #google #flutterappdeveloper #softwareengineer #seniorsoftwareengineer #mobileapplication #mobileappdeveloper #andheri #andherieast #andheriwest #santacruz #goregaon #borivali #mobile #appdevelopement #bandra #vileparle #santacruz #jobs #itdevelopment #mangal #mangalvijeyata #mumbai #churchgate #chakala #vibes #india #instagram #facebook #twitter #itrecruitment\n\nJob Type: Full-time\n\nSalary: ₹600,000.00 - ₹900,000.00 per year\n\nSchedule:\nDay shift\nMonday to Friday\nExperience:\nflutter development: 2 years (Preferred)\nwork: 1 year (Preferred)\nEducation:\nBachelor's (Preferred)"
