   "Job Description": "We are looking for someone who understands the entire cloud architecture end to end. Also, the One who will take entire responsibility for maintaining the cloud architecture and run the show, One who enjoys debugging and takes pride in scaling the application second to none.\nResponsibilities:\nManage the development of continuous integration and deployment solutions for production applications across various sites/software\nWill be in charge of designing, and optimizing the automation systems both for mobile and web applications\nCoaches and support the engineering development department personnel in the workings of reusable tools and patterns, for example, reusable code.\nRequirements:\nExperience with PaaS offerings like Ali RDS, Ali Redis, Ali Kubernetes services.\nExperience in setting up end to end CI/CD Pipelines using Jenkins, Git Hooks, Git Actions, Git lab.\nExperience with Docker, Kubernetes, Kafka setup.\nAbility to design and deploy environments that will comply with PCI DSS, HIPPA, and FedRamp standards.\nMinimum of 3 years experience in the related fields.\nIf you think the above sounds fascinating, don’t hesitate to apply to us. Our team will get back to you as soonest. Thank you!"
